sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Platform Management
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ReportsPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ExportPlatformReportBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ExportPlatformReportController
  participant PlatformReportGenerator as «control»<br/>PlatformReportGenerator
  participant ReportCsvRenderer as «control»<br/>ReportCsvRenderer
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: export a report as CSV
  UI->>B: GET /api/management/reports/export (JWT)
  B->>C: export(ReportPeriodType period, LocalDate date)
  C->>PlatformReportGenerator: generate(period, date)
  PlatformReportGenerator->>ReportCsvRenderer: render()
  ReportCsvRenderer-->>PlatformReportGenerator: result
  PlatformReportGenerator-->>C: PlatformReport
  C-->>B: CsvExport
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result